# Fixed defect 2373, 2026-11-09, lane b26-misc, a shape beside it in the
# program's own file: a nested `use`, and one with an `as`, each beside a
# function of the name it binds.
#
# SYMPTOM: `shadowed_binding` quoted the binding as the line, *`use strs`
# binds `strs`* for `use text/strs` and *`use clip` binds `clip`* for
# `use text/words as clip`, lines this file does not hold.
#
# FIX: each line is quoted as written, its `as` too.
use text/strs  #~ shadowed_binding
use text/words as clip  #~ shadowed_binding

# What the first use would name.
function strs() -> str
    return "x"

# What the second use would name.
function clip() -> str
    return "y"

function main()
    print(strs() + clip())
